n (`y: [0, -8, 0]`, 5.5s loop).\\n- **Telemetry Overlays**:\\n  - Left HUD Card: `0-60 MPH // 2.8s (Launch Control)`\\n  - Right HUD Card: `PEAK POWERTRAIN // 750 HP • Dual-Motor AWD`\\n  - Bottom Spec Ribbon: `Active Torque Vectoring`, `800V Architecture`, `380 mi EPA`, `AI Confidence: 98.4%`.\\n\\n### Micro-Interactions & Scroll Indicator\\n- **Text & Element Entrance**: Staggered slide-up and fade-in animations with custom cubic-bezier easing (`[0.16, 1, 0.3, 1]`).\\n- **Scroll Indicator**: Bottom center animated mous\n<truncated 1002 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough artifact for Hero section implementation\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chauh\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\10f22c6a-7cf9-4af6-ab9e-ed172ecaddf1\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough artifact\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
